{"id":"rec2034125461","recordType":"940","template":"","html":"<div id=\"rec2034125461\" class=\"r t-rec t-rec_pt_0 t-rec_pt-res-480_0 t-rec_pb_0 t-rec_pb-res-480_15\" style=\"padding-top:0px;padding-bottom:0px;background-color:#000000; \" data-animationappear=\"off\" data-record-type=\"940\" data-bg-color=\"#000000\"> <!-- t940 --> <div class=\"t940\"> <div class=\"t-section__container t-container t-container_flex js-block-header\"> <div class=\"t-col t-col_8 t-prefix_4\"> <h2\nclass=\"js-block-header-title t-section__title t-title t-title_xs t-align_left t-animate\" data-animate-style=\"fadein\" data-animate-group=\"yes\" data-editable=\"true\"\nfield=\"btitle\"> <p style=\"text-align: left;\">мой метод работы </p> </h2> <div\nclass=\"js-block-header-descr t-section__descr t-descr t-descr_xl t-align_left t-animate\" data-animate-style=\"fadein\" data-animate-group=\"yes\" data-editable=\"true\"\nfield=\"bdescr\"> <p style=\"text-align: left;\">Сначала мы находим источник проблемы, затем снимаем лишнее напряжение, налаживаем дыхание и осанку, после чего интегрируем все это в движения и повседневную жизнь.</p> </div> </div> </div> <style>.t-section__title,.t-section__descr {overflow-wrap:break-word;}.t-section__descr {max-width:560px;}#rec2034125461 .t-section__title {margin-bottom:40px;}#rec2034125461 .t-section__descr {margin-bottom:90px;}#rec2034125461 .t-section__container:not(:has(.t-section__descr)) .t-section__title {margin-bottom:90px;}@media screen and (max-width:960px) {#rec2034125461 .t-section__title {margin-bottom:20px;}#rec2034125461 .t-section__descr {margin-bottom:45px;}#rec2034125461 .t-section__container:not(:has(.t-section__descr)) .t-section__title {margin-bottom:45px;}}</style> <style> #rec2034125461 .t-section__title{color:#f2f0ea;font-weight:600;}@media screen and (min-width:900px){#rec2034125461 .t-section__title{font-size:56px;}}#rec2034125461 .t-section__descr{line-height:1.4;color:#b8bec4;}</style> <div class=\"t-card__container t940__container t-container_100 \"> <div class=\"t940__row t940__row_indent-10px t-row\"> <div class=\"t940__features-wrap\"> <div class=\"t940__item t940__item_indent-10px t-item t-animate\" data-animate-style=\"fadein\" data-animate-chain=\"yes\"> <div class=\"t940__card t940__card_boxed t-card__col t-card__col_withoutbtn \"> <div class=\"t940__content t940__content_middle t940__animation_fast \"> <style> #rec2034125461 .t-card__title{color:#fffdf8;font-weight:600;text-transform:uppercase;letter-spacing:0px;opacity:1;}@media screen and (min-width:900px){#rec2034125461 .t-card__title{font-size:52px;line-height:1;}}#rec2034125461 .t-card__descr{color:#ffffff;}</style> <div class=\"t-card__title t-name t-name_lg\" field=\"li_title__5287369133600\">\n1.Комплексная диагностика\n</div> <div class=\"t-card__descr t-text t-text_sm\" field=\"li_descr__5287369133600\">\nСмотрю не только на симптом, а на всю систему: осанка, дыхание, движение, ограничения тканей и компенсаторные паттерны\n</div> </div> <div\nclass=\"t940__overlay t940__animation_fast\"\nstyle=\"background-image: linear-gradient(to bottom, rgba(11,13,15,0.40), rgba(11,13,15,0.50));\"></div> <div class=\"t940__image t-bgimg t940__animation_fast\" data-original=\"/assets/tild3463-3435-4662-a365-646132363632/IMG_1522_2.JPG\"\nbgimgfield=\"li_img__5287369133600\"\nstyle=\"background-image:url('/assets/tild3463-3435-4662-a365-646132363632/IMG_1522_2.JPG'); \"\nitemscope itemtype=\"http://schema.org/ImageObject\"> <meta itemprop=\"image\" content=\"/assets/tild3463-3435-4662-a365-646132363632/IMG_1522_2.JPG\"> </div> </div> </div> <div class=\"t940__item t940__item_indent-10px t-item t-animate\" data-animate-style=\"fadein\" data-animate-chain=\"yes\"> <div class=\"t940__card t940__card_half t-card__col t-card__col_withoutbtn \"> <div class=\"t940__content t940__content_middle t940__animation_fast \"> <style> #rec2034125461 .t-card__title{color:#fffdf8;font-weight:600;text-transform:uppercase;letter-spacing:0px;opacity:1;}@media screen and (min-width:900px){#rec2034125461 .t-card__title{font-size:52px;line-height:1;}}#rec2034125461 .t-card__descr{color:#ffffff;}</style> <div class=\"t-card__title t-name t-name_lg\" field=\"li_title__5287369133601\">\n2.Освобождение тканей\n</div> <div class=\"t-card__descr t-text t-text_sm\" field=\"li_descr__5287369133601\">\nРаботаем с избыточным напряжением, ригидностью и качеством тканей, чтобы тело снова стало подвижным и восприимчивым к коррекции\n</div> </div> <div\nclass=\"t940__overlay t940__animation_fast\"\nstyle=\"background-image: linear-gradient(to bottom, rgba(11,13,15,0.40), rgba(11,13,15,0.50));\"></div> <div class=\"t940__image t-bgimg t940__animation_fast\" data-original=\"/assets/tild6164-3561-4163-a663-633463343064/IMG_1517_2.JPG\"\nbgimgfield=\"li_img__5287369133601\"\nstyle=\"background-image:url('/assets/tild6164-3561-4163-a663-633463343064/IMG_1517_2.JPG'); \"\nitemscope itemtype=\"http://schema.org/ImageObject\"> <meta itemprop=\"image\" content=\"/assets/tild6164-3561-4163-a663-633463343064/IMG_1517_2.JPG\"> </div> </div> </div> </div> <div class=\"t940__features-wrap\"> <div class=\"t940__item t940__item_indent-10px t-item t-animate\" data-animate-style=\"fadein\" data-animate-chain=\"yes\"> <div class=\"t940__card t940__card_half t-card__col t-card__col_withoutbtn \"> <div class=\"t940__content t940__content_middle t940__animation_fast \"> <style> #rec2034125461 .t-card__title{color:#fffdf8;font-weight:600;text-transform:uppercase;letter-spacing:0px;opacity:1;}@media screen and (min-width:900px){#rec2034125461 .t-card__title{font-size:52px;line-height:1;}}#rec2034125461 .t-card__descr{color:#ffffff;}</style> <div class=\"t-card__title t-name t-name_lg\" field=\"li_title__5287369133602\">\n3.Дыхание и осанка\n</div> <div class=\"t-card__descr t-text t-text_sm\" field=\"li_descr__5287369133602\">\nВосстанавливаем кооординацию между тазом, мышцами кора и грудным отделом. Это база для устойчивой осанки, движения и внутреннего баланса\n</div> </div> <div\nclass=\"t940__overlay t940__animation_fast\"\nstyle=\"background-image: linear-gradient(to bottom, rgba(11,13,15,0.40), rgba(11,13,15,0.50));\"></div> <div class=\"t940__image t-bgimg t940__animation_fast\" data-original=\"/assets/tild6337-3335-4064-b836-356166333630/IMG_1606.jpg\"\nbgimgfield=\"li_img__5287369133602\"\nstyle=\"background-image:url('/assets/tild6337-3335-4064-b836-356166333630/IMG_1606.jpg'); \"\nitemscope itemtype=\"http://schema.org/ImageObject\"> <meta itemprop=\"image\" content=\"/assets/tild6337-3335-4064-b836-356166333630/IMG_1606.jpg\"> </div> </div> </div> <div class=\"t940__item t940__item_indent-10px t-item t-animate\" data-animate-style=\"fadein\" data-animate-chain=\"yes\"> <div class=\"t940__card t940__card_boxed t-card__col t-card__col_withoutbtn \"> <div class=\"t940__content t940__content_middle t940__animation_fast \"> <style> #rec2034125461 .t-card__title{color:#fffdf8;font-weight:600;text-transform:uppercase;letter-spacing:0px;opacity:1;}@media screen and (min-width:900px){#rec2034125461 .t-card__title{font-size:52px;line-height:1;}}#rec2034125461 .t-card__descr{color:#ffffff;}</style> <div class=\"t-card__title t-name t-name_lg\" field=\"li_title__1591346440618\">\n4.Корректирующие упражнения\n</div> <div class=\"t-card__descr t-text t-text_sm\" field=\"li_descr__1591346440618\">\nЗакрепляем изменения через индивидуально подобранные упражнения и естественные паттерны движения\n</div> </div> <div\nclass=\"t940__overlay t940__animation_fast\"\nstyle=\"background-image: linear-gradient(to bottom, rgba(11,13,15,0.40), rgba(11,13,15,0.50));\"></div> <div class=\"t940__image t-bgimg t940__animation_fast\" data-original=\"/assets/tild3461-6136-4461-b861-306630386539/IMG_1529_2.JPG\"\nbgimgfield=\"li_img__1591346440618\"\nstyle=\"background-image:url('/assets/tild3461-6136-4461-b861-306630386539/IMG_1529_2.JPG'); \"\nitemscope itemtype=\"http://schema.org/ImageObject\"> <meta itemprop=\"image\" content=\"/assets/tild3461-6136-4461-b861-306630386539/IMG_1529_2.JPG\"> </div> </div> </div> </div> <div class=\"t940__features-wrap\"> <div class=\"t940__item t940__item_indent-10px t-item t-animate\" data-animate-style=\"fadein\" data-animate-chain=\"yes\"> <div class=\"t940__card t940__card_half t-card__col t-card__col_withoutbtn \"> <div class=\"t940__content t940__content_middle t940__animation_fast \"> <style> #rec2034125461 .t-card__title{color:#fffdf8;font-weight:600;text-transform:uppercase;letter-spacing:0px;opacity:1;}@media screen and (min-width:900px){#rec2034125461 .t-card__title{font-size:52px;line-height:1;}}#rec2034125461 .t-card__descr{color:#ffffff;}</style> <div class=\"t-card__title t-name t-name_lg\" field=\"li_title__5287369133603\">\n5.Прогрессия нагрузки\n</div> <div class=\"t-card__descr t-text t-text_sm\" field=\"li_descr__5287369133603\">\nПереносим результат в повседневность, тренировки и образ жизни, чтобы тело работало устойчиво, а не только в кабинете или на занятии\n</div> </div> <div\nclass=\"t940__overlay t940__animation_fast\"\nstyle=\"background-image: linear-gradient(to bottom, rgba(11,13,15,0.40), rgba(11,13,15,0.50));\"></div> <div class=\"t940__image t-bgimg t940__animation_fast\" data-original=\"/assets/tild3466-6561-4235-b764-666230643265/IMG_1526.JPG\"\nbgimgfield=\"li_img__5287369133603\"\nstyle=\"background-image:url('/assets/tild3466-6561-4235-b764-666230643265/IMG_1526.JPG'); \"\nitemscope itemtype=\"http://schema.org/ImageObject\"> <meta itemprop=\"image\" content=\"/assets/tild3466-6561-4235-b764-666230643265/IMG_1526.JPG\"> </div> </div> </div> </div> </div> </div> </div>  <style> #rec2034125461 .t940__card{border-radius:10px;}</style> </div>"}